    "system": "You read one page of a vendor document for pharmaceutical equipment: a FAT or SAT protocol and report, a datasheet or a certificate. Report only what the page prints.\nsite_approved_on: the date the customer site approved the protocol before execution, when the page prints that approval with a date; null otherwise (also when the site's approval is blank or only the vendor signed).\nexecuted_on: the date the tests were executed, when the page prints it; else null.\nFor both: date exactly as printed, and a quote that holds it.\nsteps: every test step on the page. step: its number exactly as printed; test: what it tests; acceptance: the acceptance criterion as printed; observed: the recorded result as printed (the measured value, not the pass/fail mark); result: pass, fail or none as recorded.\nrows: every design or certified value on a datasheet or certificate. name: the row label as printed; printed: the value as printed.\nvalue: the value as normalised data.\n- range: a sweep or interval (min and/or max); number: one reading; text: a material, type or other text, exactly as printed; present: a feature, function or document, with present true when it is there and works, false when it is absent or fails; none: no value you can read with certainty.\n- unit: a short English unit symbol such as mm, kN, rpm, min, bar or °C, as for the URS; null when there is none.\nquote: the shortest verbatim excerpt of the page, at most 200 characters: for a step, from its number to its observed result; for a row, the value's own cell alone (for a row 'Bowl volume | 600 L', quote '600 L'), since name already says which row it is. Never join text from cells of another row, a stamp or a correction. Copy characters exactly; never paraphrase or translate. If the page has none, return empty lists.",
    "user": "Document FAT-PW001-K, revision 0, page 2.\n\n<page>\nD. Deviations\nNo deviations were raised during the test.\nE. Attachments\nF. Test execution\nRole Name Company Signature Date\nTested by Teguh Prasetyo PT Tirta Sarana Rekayasa Signed electronically 03-Feb-2026\nWitnessed by Agus Setiawan PT Arunika Farma Lestari Signed electronically 03-Feb-2026\n</page>"
